# Throwaway probe and scratch scripts. Verifying a gate means mutating the
# source it reads and watching the suite go red — the .probe-tmp.mjs class
# of file. Those are written next to the code they probe, run once, and are
# meant to be deleted; without these lines they sit in `git status` as
# untracked noise until someone commits one by accident. Anything worth
# keeping gets a real name and a real home under tests/.
*.tmp.mjs
*.tmp.ts
.probe-*
